WEBVTT

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:39.760
I am exhausted. My new exercise class is so hard.

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:45.780
Your new exercise class?

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:51.860
Yeah. My new advanced exercise class.

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:56.720
Why advanced?

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:03.560
the beginner's class was too easy for me.

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:07.240
Too easy for you?

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:12.320
Don't laugh. In the beginner's class,

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:15.140
they give you a chance to rest between exercises.

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:16.320
So?

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:19.210
The advanced class is nonstop.

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:23.560
I lift weights every morning for sixty minutes

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:24.360
without stopping.

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:26.400
No problem.

00:01:28.970 --> 00:01:29.930
Listen, Richard,

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:34.740
doing aerobics for an hour is a lot different than lifting weights.

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:36.640
Yeah. Quite a bit different.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.380
I think aerobics is easy.

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:41.540
I could work out in your class with no problem.

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:45.240
You think so?

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:47.080
Oh, without a doubt.

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:49.060
When's the next class?

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:54.420
Tomorrow morning at ten o'clock. Try it.

00:01:56.740 --> 00:01:59.500
Tomorrow morning after lifting weights,

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:00.550
I'll try aerobics.

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:29.700
Of Course. Easy. No sweat.

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:34.040
You are not going to be able to move

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:36.420
after this and the aerobics class.

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:37.740
Are you kidding me?

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:40.420
It's going to be a piece of cake.

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:49.200
Yeah. What's the bet?

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:53.420
I bet I can go one hour in your class this morning

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.140
and not feel a thing!

00:02:57.220 --> 00:03:04.620
The bet is -- I win, and you cook dinner for the entire family.

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:08.160
Or you win, and I cook dinner for the entire family.

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:10.080
It's a bet.

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:16.660
His number is 555-8842.

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:20.420
The advanced class starts at ten o'clock.

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:24.460
It only takes eight minutes by bicycle to the aerobics class.

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:26.100
Give him a call.

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:41.620
Jack Davis, please.

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:42.500
This is Jack Davis.

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:44.420
Hello. This is Richard Stewart.

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:47.080
My wife, Marilyn Stewart, is a member of your program.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:48.400
I'd like to come to

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:53.760
Oh, fine, fine. Be here a few minutes early.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:56.480
You need to complete some forms before the class.

00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:58.020
Thanks. I'm on my way over.

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:07.270
Bye-bye. It's all set. I'm going.

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:08.980
Bye.

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:10.320
See you later.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:11.620
Good luck.

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:14.820
Don't forget about the bet.

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:16.880
Dinner for the entire family.

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:18.360
And that includes Susan.

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:19.740
Don't you forget.
